{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tatsuya and Kaori Iwase are happily spending the day in their apartment when a new married couple moves into the apartment next door. The Kayabes seem like nice people, which puts the Iwases at ease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, they soon come to realize just how thin their apartment walls are when they are subjected to noises coming from the Kayabes\u2019 apartment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will the Iwases confront their neighbors and will the nightly disturbances cease? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A lighthearted visual novel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Japanese voice acting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">E-mote animated character sprites</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488820/extras/KaoriEN.png?t=1747098048\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kaori Iwase</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Mint Amami</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lively and strong-willed, Mrs. Iwase works at a supermarket three days a week. She likes to believe that her gaining weight is all down to her growing older. Now that she\u2019s in her late thirties, she\u2019s been thinking about having children but hasn\u2019t been able to tell her husband.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488820/extras/TatsuyaEN.png?t=1747098048\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tatsuya Iwase</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A bit indecisive and easily swayed, Mr. Iwase works for peanuts at a mid-sized company in their sales department. Mild-mannered and affable, he prefers to avoid conflict. But when push comes to shove, will he grow a backbone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488820/extras/YuunaEN.png?t=1747098048\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Yuuna Kayabe</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Karen Hanadera</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mrs. Kayabe has a calm and gentle way about her. She\u2019s the breadwinner for her family and works nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488820/extras/ManzouEN.png?t=1747098048\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manzou Kayabe</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mr. Kayabe seems like a stout, good-natured, and humble man.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3488820?t=1747098048","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488820/81358a9dacb0c2dbfe291cad49ecb4a98315c54b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747098048","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488820/b684e8113e661e5982b1530d65b3ee7dd2a58893/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747098048","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488820/b684e8113e661e5982b1530d65b3ee7dd2a58893/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747098048","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,4,5],"notes":"Contains mild mature themes and non-explicit sexual content. All characters are over the age of 18."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tatsuya and Kaori Iwase are happily spending the