?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488820/extras/YuunaEN.png?t=1747098048\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Yuuna Kayabe</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Karen Hanadera</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mrs. Kayabe has a calm and gentle way about her. She\u2019s the breadwinner for her family and works nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488820/extras/ManzouEN.png?t=1747098048\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manzou Kayabe</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mr. Kayabe seems like a stout, good-natured, and humble man.</p>","developers":["ANIM"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488820/a681c3718f278b44c9e59804efe5096a79a35405/header.jpg?t=1747098048","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257124385,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124385/movie480.mp4?t=1747098046","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124385/movie_max.mp4?t=1747098046"},"name":"My Wife\u2019s Voice Through the Wall Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257124385/a974d8b72e16074f0b6a32786376d11a84fb4fa5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747098046","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124385/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747098046","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124385/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747098046"}}],"name":"My Wife\u2019s Voice Through the Wall","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Wind